		<title>Madonna's W.E. Vionnet installation at Harvey Nichols London: Photographs of the Showcasing</title>
		<link rel="alternate" type="text/html" href="http://drownedmadonna.com/index/item/124-madonnas-we-vionnet-installation-at-harvey-nichols-london-photographs-of-the-showcasing.html"/>
		<published>2011-09-26T14:11:42Z</published>
		<updated>2011-09-26T14:11:42Z</updated>
